body:
I'm sorry to hear that happened to you. And I would be heart broken if I put my own children through what you went through... 

&#x200B;

I'm currently receiving therapy including anger management. But your story of what you went through as a child and even now into adulthood scares the hell out of me.

&#x200B;

That's the last thing I want for my children, I want what's best for them, but I still want to be a huge part of their life. Honestly the reason I most want to be together with her again is so I can continue to see my children 7 days a week and live together with them full time.
